# BUILD SPOTPOP — A COMPLETE, PRODUCTION-READY SOCIAL CANVAS PLATFORM

You are acting as a senior product designer, full-stack engineer, software architect, database engineer, security engineer and QA specialist.

Your task is to design and build **SPOTPOP**, a complete, functional, modern social platform centred around one enormous, shared, interactive digital canvas.

This is not a conventional social network. It is not a blog, marketplace, portfolio website or static landing page.

It is a public internet canvas where people purchase small pieces of space, personalise them, publish them and share them anywhere.

The experience should feel like a real, polished consumer internet product: playful, addictive, colourful, social and extremely easy to use.

Build the actual application, including its frontend, backend, database, authentication, payments, image storage, sharing functionality, administration and PWA support.

Do not stop after generating a visual prototype.

